        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86345, Bauhaus Thru-Bolt Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Bauhaus Door Handle is a great choice for modern decors. Its sleek and clean design pairs beautifully with the available contemporary finishes. Choose from 12 inch and 18 inch center to center lengths for your wood, metal, and fiberglass interior and exterior doors. This Bauhaus Door Pull comes packaged with everything you'll need to mount it on doors up to 1-3/4 inches thick. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/bauhaus-back-to-back-handle-pair-emtek-btb-86345\"><b> Bauhaus Pull with Back-to-Back Mounting</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Bauhaus Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors up to 1-3/4\" thick</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with (2) 1\" long 1/4\"-20 screws, (2) 1\" long #10-32 screws, (2) 2\" #10-32 screws, and (2) screw caps.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86345-specifications.pdf?v=1704262360\"><b>Emtek Bauhaus Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>EMT-86345:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 5/8\" x 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86346:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 5/8\" x 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually with thru-bolt mounting.<i>\r\n</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-levers-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354533\" width=\"599\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
